# No credential rotation

Do **not** rotate, reset, update, or change passwords, emails, or auth credentials for Sandbox staff accounts (including Jen's Fancy Venue / `jennifer@hellotocheers.com`) or any other shared test login.

## Forbidden

- Calling password-reset / update-user / admin set-password APIs for shared Sandbox accounts
- Changing password to unblock yourself or "heal" a login
- Creating a replacement staff user and treating it as the canonical login
- Asking the user to wait while you rotate credentials

## Required

- Use the **existing** documented Sandbox credentials as-is
- If login fails, report the failure and diagnose (wrong env, locked account, wrong URL) — do **not** rotate
- Prefer an existing browser session over re-authenticating when possible
- Never bump the human user out of the app by changing credentials mid-session

If credentials are genuinely unknown or broken, ask the user — do not invent a fix by rotating.
